#: rc.cpp:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<p>If this option is checked, the entries in the playlist will be relative to "
"its location.\n"
"<p>Example: If your playlist is located in <em>/home/myself/music</em> and\n"
"your audio files are in <em>/home/myself/music/cool</em>"
