#~ msgid "Here you can smooth the video during the encoding process. It is better to leave crispness at 100% for encoding and smooth the video during playback instead."
#~ msgstr "Die video kan hier tydens die enkodering proses glad gemaak word. Dit is egter beter om die skerpheid op 100% te los tydens die enkodering proses en dit dan glad te maak tyden terugspeel."

#~ msgid "Select the language and the surround mode. Typically there are \"MPEG2 Stereo\", \"AC3 2ch and 6ch\" and \"DTS 6ch\". You can probably choose AC3 6ch, AC3 2ch and MPEG2 Stereo in descending order, depending on your language (It doesn't matter if DTS works or not, you can still try it)."
#~ msgstr "Kies die taal en die multikanaal (\"surround\") modus. Tipiese waardes is \"MPEG2 Stereo\", \"AC3 2 en 6 kanaal\" en \"DTS 6 kanaal\". Die gewenste keuses is gewoonlik, in afgaande volgorde, AC3 6kanaal, AC3 2 kanaal en MPEG Stereo, afhangende van jou taal."

#~ msgid "Deinterlace mode:"
#~ msgstr "Deinterlace modus:"

#~ msgid "Select a deinterlace mode if you have interlaced material.<ul><li><strong>Fast</strong> is the standard deinterlace mode</li><li><strong>Encoder Based</strong> uses the internal deinterlace of the codec (be aware that some codecs may have no deinterlacer)</li><li><strong>Zoom to Full Frame</strong> no matter how it works but it is rather good and slow. Use this if <strong>Fast</strong> still produces interlace stripes or color artifacts (red shadow, etc.)<li><li><strong>Drop Field/Half Height</strong> uses only one field and scales it.</li><li><strong>SmartDeinterlace</strong> provides a smart, motion-based deinterlacing capability. Ported from VirtualDub by Tilmann Bitterberg. Operates in RGB space only. Tilmann did some testing of deinterlace filters available in transcode. You can view and read the result on tibit.org/video/. </li><li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is a deinterlace for YUV mode by Thomas Oestreich.</li></ul>"
#~ msgstr "Kies die \"deinterlace\" modus as die materiaal ge-\"interlace\" is.<ul><li><strong>Vinnig</strong> is die standaard \"deinterlace\" modus.</li><li><strong>Kodeerder Gebaseer</strong> maak van die dekodeerder se eie \"deinterlace\" meganisme gebruik. (Let daarop dat sommige kodeerders nie \"deinterlace\" funksionaliteit het nie.)</li><li><strong>Skaleer na volle raam</strong> - Hierdie metode is stadig maar gee goeie resultate. Hierdie modus word aanbeveel as <strong>vinnig</strong> nogsteeds \"interlace\" strepe en kleur afwykings veroorsaak.</li><li><strong>Ignoreer Veld/Halwe Hoogte</strong> gebruik net die een veld en skaleer dit na volle grootte.</li><li><strong>SmartDeinterlace</strong> bied 'n intelligente, beweging gebaseerde \"deinterlace\" filter. Dit is vanaf VirtualDub, deur Tilmann Bitterberg, oorgedra. Dit werk net in die RBG kleur skema. Die resultate van Tilmann se toetse kan besigtig word by http://tibit.org/video/</li><li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is 'n \"deinterlace\" filter vir die YUV kleur skema, deur Thomas Oestreich.</li></ul>"

#~ msgid "If this is checked, the audio track will be downsampled from 48 kHz to 44.1 kHz. Useful because some soundcards have problems with a sampling rate of 48 kHz."
#~ msgstr "As hierdie opsie gekies is sal die snit se monster tempo van 48 kHz na 44.1 kHz verlaag word. Dit is nuttig vir sommige klank kaarte wat nie 44.1 kHz monster tempo kan handteer nie."

